---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { languages, ui, type Lang } from "../../i18n";
export function getStaticPaths() {
  return languages.map((lang) => ({ params: { lang } }));
}
const lang = Astro.params.lang as Lang;
---

<Layout lang={lang} title={ui[lang].styleGuide} path="style-guide/" noindex>
  <header class="page-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">Toward Less · Design system</p><h1>{ui[lang].styleGuide}</h1><p>
      {ui[lang].styleDescription}
    </p>
  </header>
  <div class="prose">
    <h2>Quiet, not empty. Readable, not ornamental.</h2>
    <p>
      This page is a design reference, not a blog post. It is excluded from search indexing and the
      sitemap.
    </p>
    <h2 lang="vi">Bớt chấp thủ. Thấy rõ hơn.</h2>
    <p lang="vi">
      Trách nhiệm với gia đình, sự tử tế trong công việc và khả năng nhìn rõ thực tại. Chữ tiếng
      Việt cần đủ khoảng thở: ă â ê ô ơ ư đ — Ắ Ằ Ẳ Ẵ Ặ Ấ Ầ Ẩ Ẫ Ậ Ế Ề Ể Ễ Ệ Ố Ồ Ổ Ỗ Ộ Ớ Ờ Ở Ỡ Ợ Ứ Ừ
      Ử Ữ Ự.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Emphasis</strong>, <em>reflection</em>, <a href="#code-sample">a useful link</a>, and
      Pāli: sati, paññā, dukkha, anattā.
    </p>
    <blockquote>
      <p>
        Less unnecessary complexity, distraction, and clinging. Not less responsibility, care, or
        useful work.
      </p>
    </blockquote>
    <div class="swatches">
      <div class="swatch" style="background:var(--paper)">Paper · --paper</div><div
        class="swatch"
        style="background:var(--surface)"
      >
        Surface · --surface
      </div><div class="swatch" style="background:var(--accent);color:var(--paper)">
        Accent · --accent
      </div>
    </div>
    <h2 id="code-sample">Technical writing</h2>
    <p>Inline <code>translationKey</code> and code blocks remain legible.</p>
    <pre
      tabindex="0"
      aria-label="Code example"><code>{'const direction = "toward less";\nconst practice = () => observeReality();\n// A long line should scroll inside the code block, never make the entire page overflow. '.repeat(2)}</code></pre>
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Decision</th></tr></thead><tbody
        ><tr><td>Body</td><td>Noto Serif, generous line height</td></tr><tr
          ><td>Interface</td><td>Be Vietnam Pro, sentence case</td></tr
        ><tr><td>Motion</td><td>None required; reduced motion respected</td></tr></tbody>
    </table>
    <h3>A smaller heading</h3><p>
      One reading column. No autoplay, popups, tracking, or social counters.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
